# Rejected rounds, work in progress, review dumps and run transcripts stay out of git; each folder's REPORT.md and
# FEEDBACK files say what they showed. Kept: briefs, feedback, reports, prompts, scripts, the image tool's originals
# that the accepted pictures are built from, and the accepted pictures.
rounds/
work/
reject/
scratch/
iterations/
*.transcript.txt

# The keys: the underlays are made again by keys/physical.py; the review pictures and the style sheet's panels and
# study are kept out, the style and view sheets as JPEG copies in.
keys/underlay/
keys/reports/*/
keys/reports/*.png
keys/style/panels/
keys/style/*.png
!keys/style/palette.png
keys/views/sheet.png

# The moon is built from four of its originals.
moon/originals/round-*.png
!moon/originals/round-08.png
!moon/originals/round-15.png
!moon/originals/round-16.png
!moon/originals/round-17.png
